# The hero's frame contract is digested byte for byte: hero/timeline.json's
# sha1 (over the LF file) is recorded by path_plan.py, render_sequence.py, the
# encoder and the manifest, and the manifest's own text is part of the frame
# directory's content hash. A core.autocrlf checkout would turn them CRLF and
# the digests with them, so they are LF on every checkout.
hero/*.json text eol=lf
public/hero/manifest.json text eol=lf
